  "releaseNotes": "5.0.0: adds .NET 11. BREAKING: drops .NET 8 and .NET 9 (out of support), stay on 4.0.x for those. API and wire format unchanged, frames are byte identical on .NET 10 and .NET 11. Full notes: https://github.com/holonsoft/FastProtocolConverter/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
